{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kingsguard is a mix between action and strategy game, where you build up your kingdom during the day and prepare it for impending dangers during the night. Will you lead your kingdom into victory or will you let it fall into darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319240/extras/0c782f4459ed71cca7ef3db0c67a14c4.avif?t=1741788664\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319240/extras_big/0c782f4459ed71cca7ef3db0c67a14c4.avif?t=1741788664 width=800 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the day you build up your defense. You build turrets and caserns in order to raise your army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319240/extras/6c9d632506dd071c5f3e0d2e4c10d233.poster.avif?t=1741788664\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319240/extras/6c9d632506dd071c5f3e0d2e4c10d233.webm?t=1741788664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319240/extras/6c9d632506dd071c5f3e0d2e4c10d233.mp4?t=1741788664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But during the night you must defend your kingdom. You can either let your turrets fight for you or you can lead your army into the fight or you can even fight on the battlefield yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319240/extras/7f28d95160f40ffd508b0d930b6795ce.poster.avif?t=1741788664\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319240/extras/7f28d95160f40ffd508b0d930b6795ce.webm?t=1741788664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319240/extras/7f28d95160f40ffd508b0d930b6795ce.mp4?t=1741788664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3319240?t=1741788664","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3319240?t=1741788664","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319240/064a05bf8658b9158979378b7656e4348a84efc4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741788664","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319240/064a05bf8658b9158979378b7656e4348a84efc4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741788664","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3357350,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kingsguard is a mix between action and strategy game, where you build up your kingdom during the day and prepare it for impending dangers during the night. Will you lead your kingdom into victory or will you let it fall into darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319240/extras/0c782f4459ed71cca7ef3db0c67a14c4.avif?t=1741788664\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319240/extras_big/0c782f4459ed71cca7ef3db0c67a14c4.avif?t=1741788664 width=800 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the day you build up your defense. You build turrets and caserns in order